Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] Gate unloaded sweeper subscription scans on SQLite
 commits

Retain structural candidates across connections; leave recovery and positive delivery checks active each pass. Preserve caller transactions and cache row isolation. Tests: 47 passed including 12 idle regressions; six key/filter mutations killed. Same-input projection benchmark ~38ms to ~0.55ms; not a whole-gateway CPU claim. Full cadence replay and publication remain pending.
